; Graphic Layout: Berk Facing Out
;
; Berk facing out of the screen. The put-down script at #R$BA23 loads
; #R$963B. Idle and held poses continue at #R$9647. Facing into the screen
; continues at #R$985A.
;
; .
;
; Arms outstretched, animated.
; .
; #UDGTABLE
; { #LAYOUT$3B,$96(layout-963b) }
; UDGTABLE#
@label=GraphicLayout_BerkFacingOut
b$963B DEFB $FB,$93,$96                                                                 ; Process the nested layout at
                                                                                        ; #R(#PEEK(#PC+$01)+#PEEK(#PC+$02)*$0100), then return to the base coordinates.
