 $E83B JP $E73D      ; Jump to #R$E73D to advance Graphic Layout Pointer By
                     ; One.
; View the equivalent code in;
; #LIST
; { #FLUNKY$9A75 }
; LIST#

; Graphic Layout Routine: (#N$F4) Set Current Graphic Set Index
;
; Switch the current graphic set to the layout operand's index.
